<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">YOUR MOMENTS</view><view class="title">我的预约</view
  ><view class="subtitle">每一段为自己预留的时光，都在这里。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{isMerchant}}" class="card row" bindtap="openMerchant"><text>商家工作台</text><text class="muted">管理预约与接单日期 →</text></view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"
    >{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view
  ><view
    wx:for="{{items}}"
    wx:key="_id"
    class="card"
    bindtap="open"
    data-id="{{item._id}}"
    ><view class="row"
      ><text style="font-size: 32rpx; font-weight: 600"
        >{{item.serviceName}}</text
      ><text class="badge">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view
    ><view class="section-title" style="margin: 30rpx 0 12rpx"
      >{{item.dateLabel}}</view
    ><view class="row"
      ><text>{{item.timeLabel}}</text
      ><text class="muted">查看详情 →</text></view
    ></view
  ><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载预约…</view
  ><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !items.length}}" class="empty"
    >还没有预约<view></view>从一段属于自己的时间开始。<button
      class="button"
      bindtap="book"
    >
      探索服务
    </button></view
  ><button
    wx:if="{{cursor}}"
    class="secondary"
    bindtap="more"
    loading="{{loading}}"
  >
    加载更多
  </button></view
>
